cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the accompanying paper.
title: "Free denoising diffusion models: reference implementation"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation accompanying the paper "Free denoising diffusion
  models".  Implements the forward free Ornstein-Uhlenbeck flow and its spectral
  marginals, the reverse-time free SDE and probability flow, free denoising score
  matching, the free functional inequalities, and the design of prescribed
  equilibria, together with the nine numerical experiments reported in the paper.
